<BaseLayout title="About FourthWingDragon — Independent Empyrean Fan Tools" description="About FourthWingDragon, an independent fan site with original quizzes, a dragon reference matrix and a fantasy name generator." breadcrumbs={[{name:'About',href:'/about/'}]}><h1>About FourthWingDragon</h1><div class="prose"><p>FourthWingDragon is an independent English fan site for readers of Rebecca Yarros’s Empyrean series. It combines a dragon reference matrix with original personality quizzes, a fantasy name generator and reading guidance.</p><p>We distinguish publisher descriptions from our own creative interpretations. A quiz result is entertainment; the color and tail index is a navigation aid. Sources appear beside the reference material.</p><p>No account or payment is required. We use original interface design and do not reproduce official artwork. Start with the <a href="/dragons/">dragon types</a> or the <a href="/quiz/dragon-type/">dragon quiz</a>.</p></div></BaseLayout>
